{{Term/Store|Snowquill Trousers|Snowquill Trousers|Series, BotW, TotK, AoC}} are recurring [[Item]]s in {{TLoZ Series}}.{{Exp Game|BotW, TotK, AoC}}<ref name="BotW Inventory"/><ref name="TotK Inventory"/><ref name="AoC Allies"/>

==Locations and Uses==
==={{BotW|-}}===
{{Descriptions BotW}}
Snowquill Trousers are pieces of [[Armor]] that can be bought for 550 [[Rupee]]s at the [[Brazen Beak]]. When worn, they provide one level of [[Cold Resistance]].<ref name="BotW Inventory"/> The Snowquill Trousers can be enhanced by a [[Great Fairy]] and can be [[Dye]]d at the [[Kochi Dye Shop]]. The Snowquill Trousers, alongside the [[Snowquill Headdress]] and [[Snowquill Tunic]], compose the [[Snowquill Set]]. When each piece of the Set has been enhanced at least two times by a Great Fairy and the full Set is worn, it provides the [[Unfreezable]] [[Set Bonus]].

